---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Henning's Recipes" description="About Henning's Recipe Collection">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">About This Recipe Collection</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Welcome!</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          This is my personal recipe collection where I gather and share recipes I love to cook. 
          From quick weeknight dinners to special occasion desserts, you'll find a variety of 
          dishes that have been tested in my kitchen.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Each recipe includes detailed instructions, prep and cook times, and ingredient lists 
          to help you recreate these dishes at home. Feel free to explore, search, and try them out!
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-8 mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">How to Use This Site</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
          <li><strong>Browse:</strong> Check out recent recipes on the home page or view all recipes in the recipe index</li>
          <li><strong>Search:</strong> Use the search feature on the recipes page to find specific dishes</li>
          <li><strong>Filter:</strong> Click on categories or tags to find recipes by type</li>
          <li><strong>Print:</strong> Each recipe has a print button for easy reference while cooking</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">About the Tech</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          This site is built with <a href="https://astro.build" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Astro</a> 
          and <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Tailwind CSS</a>, 
          featuring <a href="https://pagefind.app" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Pagefind</a> for 
          fast, client-side search. It's deployed on 
          <a href="https://pages.cloudflare.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Cloudflare Pages</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          All recipes are stored as Markdown files with structured metadata, making it easy to add new recipes 
          and maintain the collection over time.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
